<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="#">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><a href="/markets/telecom">Telecommunications</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">RF &amp; High-Frequency Assembly</span></div></div><div class="mk-spoke-grid"><aside class="mk-side"><div class="side-head"><span class="side-head-label">Telecommunications products</span><button type="button" class="mk-side-toggle" aria-label="Collapse sidebar"><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></span></button></div><a class="s active" href="/markets/telecom/rf-assembly"><span class="abbr">RF</span><span class="label">RF &amp; High-Frequency Assembly</span></a><div class="helper"><div class="h">Not sure which fits?</div><p>Tell us the frequency band and the package and we&rsquo;ll point you to the right line.</p><a class="cta" href="/contact">Work with us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></aside><div class="mk-spoke-main"><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow">Telecommunications &middot; RF &amp; High-Frequency Assembly</div><h1 class="mk-h1">RF and high-frequency assembly for telecom</h1><p class="mk-lede">RF, microwave and millimeter-wave module performance depends on controlled die placement, die-attach quality, grounding, shielding and package integrity. Hana combines these assembly processes with RF measurement to verify completed modules against program requirements.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#specialize-rf-assembly" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">What we specialize in</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><div class="mk-ph" style="aspect-ratio:auto;height:420px;border-bottom:0;"><img src="~/images/photos/mk-telecommunications-card-rf-assembly.webp" alt="RF & High-Frequency Assembly" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;"></div></div></div></section><section id="specialize-rf-assembly" data-hana-bg="hex" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:var(--bg);border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">What we specialize in</h2><p class="mk-body">Hana assembles RF and microwave modules, millimeter-wave modules, RF power amplifiers and fiber-optic components. In-house RF measurement capability includes spectrum analysis, network analysis and noise-figure testing, with optical and high-frequency manufacturing experience developed over decades of telecom production.</p></div><div class="mk-sheet"><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">01</span><span class="t">RF and microwave modules</span></div><div class="desc">Module-level RF and microwave assembly with controlled ground paths, shielding and RF measurement before shipment.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">02</span><span class="t">Millimeter-wave modules</span></div><div class="desc">Millimeter-wave module assembly on dedicated high-frequency manufacturing lines.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">03</span><span class="t">RF power amplifier assembly</span></div><div class="desc">GaN-on-Si die in TO-272 plastic and metal-ceramic packages, with AuSn eutectic or sintered die attach, multi-die module assembly and ceramic-lid encapsulation.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">04</span><span class="t">Fiber-optic components</span></div><div class="desc">Optical component assembly with hermetic sealing and helium fine-leak test available where required by the package design.</div></div></div><div class="mk-caplinks"><p class="note">See System in Package for the wider multi-die integration, wafer-level processing and test capability supporting these RF module constructions.</p><div class="links"><a href="/capabilities/osat/system-in-package">Explore System in Package <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></div></div></section><section class="mk-dark"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div style="max-width:820px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark">Die attach, package sealing and RF measurement</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:0 0 14px;">Die-attach selection forms part of both the thermal and electrical design of an RF package. Hana supports AuSn eutectic and sintered attach processes according to package requirements, together with TO-272 plastic and metal-ceramic formats, multi-die module assembly and ceramic-lid or hermetic sealing. Helium fine-leak test is available for sealed packages. Completed modules can then be verified using spectrum analysis, network analysis and noise-figure measurement according to program requirements.</p></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:24px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">Footprint</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where we build</h2></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/ayutthaya"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Ayutthaya</div><div class="note">microwave and fiber-optic components, SiP and SMT</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/lamphun"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Lamphun</div><div class="note">millimeter-wave modules</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div><p style="margin:18px 0 0;"><a href="/locations" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;">All locations <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></a></p></div></section><section style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">FAQ</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Why does assembly matter more at high frequency?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">RF and high-frequency module performance depends on controlled grounding, shielding, die-attach quality and package integrity. These assembly variables form part of the electrical performance of the finished module and are therefore controlled through the manufacturing process and verified by RF measurement.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What RF products can Hana assemble?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana manufactures RF and microwave modules, millimeter-wave modules, RF power amplifiers including GaN-on-Si die in TO-272 plastic and metal-ceramic packages, multi-die modules and ceramic-lid packages, together with fiber-optic components and hermetically sealed assemblies where required.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">How does Hana test RF assemblies before shipment?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana uses rack-and-stack RF measurement including spectrum analysis, network analysis and noise-figure testing according to program requirements. Helium fine-leak testing is also available for sealed packages where required.</p></details></div><div style="margin-top:40px;padding-top:26px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><a href="/markets/telecom" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;"><i data-lucide="arrow-left" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> Back to the Telecommunications market hub</a></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Talk to us about your RF program</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us what you need built and we will come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section></div></div>
